[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_9999","text":"声乐教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0020","text":"啊，您早上好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0030","text":"早上好，来得好早"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0040","text":"是的……\n稍微，来早了一点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0050","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0060","text":"马上要录音了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0070","text":"——啊，是的，是啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0080","text":"新歌……\n果然，是首超级棒的歌呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0090","text":"光是听着就能让人心情变好……那种感觉\n——就是这样的歌呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0100","text":"快乐的心情，要怎么才能传达出去呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0110","text":"只要自己享受其中，听众那边\n自然就能感受到……这种说法经常听到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0120","text":"但要表现出来，肯定不是件简单的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0130","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0140","text":"……那么，七草小姐稍微留一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0150","text":"绯田小姐可以走了。感觉非常好\n录音也保持这个状态加油哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0160","text":"——好的\n我先失陪了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0170","text":"那个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0180","text":"对不起……！那个，到录音之前\n我一定会，那个……调整好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0190","text":"嗯，我明白了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0200","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070100_05_0013","text":"Motion"}]
